{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"自函子的迹"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"自函子的迹"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $\\mathcal{C}$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"可对偶对象","text":"可对偶"}},{"Plain":" "},{"Local":{"url":"微分分次范畴","text":"DG 范畴"}},{"Plain":", 则可定义 $\\mathcal C$ 的自函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"迹","text":"迹"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Tr}(F) \\in \\mathsf{Vect}$. 迹来自如下的复合:\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Vect} \\overset{\\mathrm{unit}}{\\to} \\mathcal C^\\vee \\otimes \\mathcal C \\overset{\\mathrm{id}\\otimes F}{\\to} \\mathcal C^\\vee\\otimes\\mathcal C \\overset{\\mathrm{counit}}{\\to} \\mathsf{Vect}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>该构造有一推广版本 ("},{"Local":{"url":"AGKRRV1","text":"AGKRRV"}},{"Plain":"): 对于函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to \\mathcal C\\otimes\\mathcal D$, 可定义 $\\operatorname{Tr}(F)\\in\\mathcal D$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n"}]}}